{
  "_comment": "Single source for the Playwright specs that need a live fixture backend. Read by scripts/gate/release_gate.py (only specs with gate=true: FIXTURE_SPECS) and by scripts/fixture_job.py (the `fixture` job of private/runner/run_smart.py). Do not change a gate flag without noting it in docs/operations/RUNNER_FIXTURE_JOB.md.",
